# Kingpin-Tools

A reconstructed version of the original Kingpin toolchain, reverse engineered from the released SDK and original binaries.

The goal of this project is source-level compatibility with the original tools and behavior matching the original implementation where possible.

This repository is focused on Kingpin tools such as `kpbsp`, `kpvis`, and `kpdata`.
`kpvis` appears to correspond closely to `qvis3`, while other parts were reconstructed from the original Kingpin binaries.
